1	SOMEWHERE NEARBY IS MYSTIC CAVE, WHERE OTHERS HAVE FOUND FORTUNES IN
1	TREASURE AND GOLD, THOUGH IT IS RUMORED THAT SOME WHO ENTER ARE NEVER
1	SEEN AGAIN.  MAGIC IS SAID TO WORK IN THE CAVE.  I WILL BE YOUR EYES
1	AND HANDS.  DIRECT ME WITH COMMANDS OF 1 OR 2 WORDS.  I SHOULD WARN
1	YOU THAT I LOOK AT ONLY THE FIRST FIVE LETTERS OF EACH WORD, SO YOU'LL
1	HAVE TO ENTER "NORTHEAST" AS "NE" TO DISTINGUISH IT FROM "NORTH".
1	(SHOULD YOU GET STUCK, TYPE "HELP" FOR SOME GENERAL HINTS.  FOR INFOR-
1	MATION ON HOW TO END YOUR ADVENTURE, ETC., TYPE "INFO".)
1				   - - -
1	THIS PROGRAM IS BASED ON THE ORIGINAL 'ADVENTURE' BY WILLIE CROWTHER
1	AS EXTENDED BY DON WOODS, AND THE 'CRYSTAL CAVE' BY JOHN KOPF.
1	THIS VARIATION IS BY MICHAEL STIMAC AT TYMSHARE. CUPERTINO CA.
1	                           - - -
1	THIS EXPLORATION IS INTENDED (BY THE AUTHOR) TO BE MORE DIFFICULT
1	THAN THE ORIGINAL 'ADVENTURE' GAME. IF YOU HAVE NOT PLAYED ADVENTURE
1	IT IS SUGGESTED (THOUGH NOT NECESSARY) THAT YOU TRY THE ORIGINAL
1	GAME FIRST.                 GOOD LUCK !!
