51	I KNOW OF PLACES, ACTIONS, AND THINGS.  MOST OF MY VOCABULARY
51	DESCRIBES PLACES AND IS USED TO MOVE YOU THERE.  TO MOVE, TRY WORDS
51	LIKE TREE, IN, OUT, CLIMB, ENTER, EAST, WEST, NORTH, SOUTH,
51	UP, OR DOWN.  I KNOW ABOUT A FEW SPECIAL OBJECTS, LIKE SOME COINS
51	IN THE OFFICE.  THESE OBJECTS CAN BE MANIPULATED USING SOME OF
51	THE ACTION WORDS THAT I KNOW.  USUALLY YOU WILL NEED TO GIVE BOTH THE
51	OBJECT AND ACTION WORDS (IN EITHER ORDER), BUT SOMETIMES I CAN INFER
51	THE OBJECT FROM THE VERB ALONE.  SOME OBJECTS ALSO IMPLY VERBS; IN
51	PARTICULAR, "INVENTORY" IMPLIES "TAKE INVENTORY", WHICH CAUSES ME TO
51	GIVE YOU A LIST OF WHAT YOU'RE CARRYING.  THE OBJECTS MAY HAVE SIDE
51	EFFECTS; FOR INSTANCE, TAKING THE CAB ALLOWS YOU TO GO SOMEPLACE
51	THAT YOU COULDN'T FIND OTHERWISE; CARRYING A CERTAIN OBJECT LETS
51	YOU FIND THE VAULT. USUALLY PEOPLE HAVING TROUBLE MOVING JUST NEED
51	TO TRY A FEW MORE WORDS. USUALLY PEOPLE TRYING UNSUCCESFULLY TO USE
51	OR ACT UPON AN OBJECT ARE ATTEMPTING TO DO SOMETHING
51	BEYOND THEIR (OR MY!) CAPABILITIES AND SHOULD TRY A COMPLETELY
51	DIFFERENT TACK.  BE AWARE THAT SOME ACTIONS MAY REQUIRE THE
51	PRESENCE OF A CERTAIN OBJECT, OR REQUIRE THAT YOU BE IN A PARTICULAR
51	LOCATION, OR BOTH.  TO SPEED THE GAME YOU CAN SOMETIMES MOVE LONG
51	DISTANCES WITH A SINGLE WORD. FOR EXAMPLE, "STATION" USUALLY GETS
51	YOU TO THE STATION FROM ANYWHERE ABOVE GROUND UNLESS FAR AWAY.
51	SOME OF THE WORDS YOU MAY ENCOUNTER ARE MAGIC WORDS; A MAGIC WORD
51	ACTS UPON ONE OR MORE OBJECTS OR UPON YOU YOURSELF. A MAGIC WORD MAY
51	REQUIRE THE PRESENCE OF A RELATED ENSORCELLED OBJECT, E.G. A
51	TRANSPORTER. NOTE THAT CAVE PASSAGES TURN A LOT, AND THAT LEAVING A
51	ROOM TO THE NORTH DOES NOT GUARANTEE ENTERING THE NEXT FROM THE SOUTH.
51	ALSO NOTE THAT THE CAVE IS NOT NECESSARILY ALL CONNECTED, AND
51	IT MAY BE REQUIRED TO ENTER IT AT MORE THAN ONE PLACE !!
