351	WHAT ELSE YOU WANTA GET RID OF?" HE ASKS SOLICITOUSLY.
352	THE TROLL IS NOT AMUSED BY YOUR RASH ACTION. DODGING YOUR ATTACK
352	IN A DEXTROUS MANNER WHICH BELIES HIS SIZE, HE COMES OUT SWINGING
352	HIS FINE SWORD.  HE GETS YOU!
353	THIS TROLL IS STONE-DEAD!
353	DO YOU *REALLY* THINK YOU CAN KILL IT AGAIN?
354	THAT WAS ONLY A RHETORICAL QUESTION.
355	DAIS - N. A RAISED PLATFORM OR BASE FOR ELEVATING OBJECTS OF
355	IMPORTANCE, SO THEY MAY BE BETTER SEEN.
356	THERE IS NO WAY TO GET PAST THE PANELS.
357	AN OPENING SHIMMERS IN THE EAST WALL!
358	AN OPENING SHIMMERS TO THE SOUTH!
359	AS YOUR LAMP COMES ON, YOU ARE SPOTTED INSTANTLY BY THE NEARBY
359	ORCS. MOST OF THEM SWING SWORDS AND AXES AT YOU! ALL OF THEM
359	GET YOU!
360	AS YOU ENTER THE CHAMBER, HIDDEN METAL PANELS FALL INTO PLACE
360	WITH A BANG! BOTH END DOORWAYS ARE SEALED OFF!
361	YOU CAN VERY DIMLY SEE, AS THOUGH THROUGH A MIST . . .
362	GOOD TRY, BUT ... ORCS HAPPEN TO GET STIRRED TO A BLOOD LUST
362	BY BUGLE MUSIC. THEY QUICKLY THROW SEVERAL AXES IN THE DIRECTION
362	OF THE SOUND. ONE OF THEM GETS YOU !
363	IT IS BOURNE UPWARDS OUT OF SIGHT BY THE DRAFT.
364	YOU ARE NOW CRUSHED AS FLAT AS A TROLL UNDER A STEAMROLLER!
365	ONLY YOUR TWITCHING BODY SEPARATES THE PITILESS WALLS!
366	ONLY TWO FEET NOW SEPARATES THE DEADLY WALLS!
366	YOU CAN NOW NOTICE A SMALL PLAQUE MOUNTED ON THE WALL.
366	THE PLAQUE, IN ELEGANT SCRIPT, PROCLAIMS:  EBS
367	THE WALLS ARE NOW ONLY THREE FEET APART. DO SOMETHING!
368	THE WALLS ARE NOW FIVE FEET APART.
369	THE WALLS ARE NOW EIGHT FEET APART.
370	AS YOU MOVE FORWARD, METAL GATES SLAM DOWN OVER BOTH DOORS!
370	A RUMBLE AND WHINE OF HIDDEN MACHINERY CAN BE HEARD.  UH OH !
371	THAT WAY IS NOW BLOCKED BY METAL GATES.
372	IF YOU HAD A STOUT POLE, MAYBE...
373	NOTHING HERE IS SUITED TO BEING BRACED.
374	THEY ARE ALREADY STOPPED.
375	I DON'T KNOW HOW TO DO THAT.
376	I WARNED YOU!   BEGONE!
377	THIS THING ALL THINGS DEVOURS: BIRDS, BEASTS, TREES, FLOWERS;
377	GNAWS IRON, BITES STEEL; GRINDS HARD STONES TO MEAL;
377	SLAYS KINGS, RUINS TOWN, AND BEATS HIGH MOUNTAIN DOWN.
378	YOU'LL HAVE TO SOLVE ANY RIDDLES YOURSELF.
379	A MYSTERIOUS FORCE IMPEDES YOUR MOTION.
380	THE BEETLE SCURRIES AWAY AS YOU APPROACH.
381	YOU *MIGHT* TRY JUMPING TO GET ACROSS.
382	THERE IS A LOUD CLAMOR AND SHOUTING NEARBY !
383	YOU HAVE BEEN FOUND BY A BAND OF ARMED ORCS ! AFTER
383	BASHING YOU ON THE HEAD, THEY RELIEVE YOU OF ALL YOUR
383	VALUABLES. IT IS SOME TIME BEFORE YOU AWAKE AND FIND
384	A SMALL BAND OF ARMED ORCS HAS PASSED BY ! FORTUNATELY
384	THEY DID NOT SPOT YOU !
385	OK, BUT DON'T BLAME ME IF YOU REGRET THIS INDULGENCE LATER.
386	IT'S ALL GONE.
386	THERE'S NOT EVEN ONE CHOCOLATE COVERED PEANUT LEFT!
387	SOME HINTS ARE AVAILABLE FOR FREE REGARDING SOME OF THE MORE
387	DIFFICULT ASPECTS OF THE CAVE.
387	READING THE MAP WILL TELL YOU WHERE IT IS AND WHERE YOU ARE.
387	YOU CANNOT GET OBJECTS INTO, OUT OF, AND AROUND THE CAVE, EXCEPT
387	BY MAGICAL MEANS. I USUALLY TELL THE TRUTH, BUT THERE ARE A FEW
387	WORDS I KNOW WHICH I PRETEND NOT TO KNOW IN THE EARLY PART OF THE
387	EXPLORATION. ONE OF THE MAZES CAN BE MAPPED BY THE TRADITIONAL
387	TECHNIQUE OF DROPPING OBJECTS, BUT THE OTHERS ARE DESIGNED
387	DELIBERATELY TO FOIL THIS. EITHER IT IS NOT NECESSARY TO MAP
387	THEM OR THERE ARE OTHER MEANS OF FINDING OUT WHAT'S GOING ON.
387	SOME ACTIONS MUST BE DONE MORE THAN ONCE, PROGRESSIVELY.
387	IT IS NOT USEFUL TO GATHER THE SCRAPS OF PAPER TO ONE LOCATION.
387	YOU JUST NEED TO READ THEM. SOME OBJECTS ARE MERELY "DECORATIVE"
387	NOTHING CAN BE DONE TO OR WITH THEM; EG. YOU CAN NEVER ENTER THE
387	FEDERAL BUILDING.
388	DO YOU NEED HELP DEALING WITH THE TROLL ?
389	THERE IS A WAY TO ATTACK THE TROLL, BUT NOTHING YOU CAN DO WHEN
389	YOU ARE CLOSE TO HIM WILL WORK.
390	SMOKE IS A PARTICULATE BY-PRODUCT OF COMBUSTION WHICH IS CARRIED
390	UPWARDS BY HOT AIR CURRENTS.
391	WITH WHAT? THERE'S NO WATER AROUND HERE.
392	THE LITTLE PLANT SHAKES IT'S LEAVES AND MURMURS "THANKS,
392	THAT WAS GOOD, BUT I'LL BE SAFE HERE ANYWAY"
393	THE LITTLE PLANT SHAKES IT'S LEAVES AND MURMURS "THANKS,
393	THAT SHOULD HOLD ME FOR A WHILE!"
394	IT WERE BEST TO LEAVE THAT AS IT IS, NOW.
